      "text": "Homicide suspect hiding out in L.A…. Not on our watch! The #PremierSector just pulled back the curtain on a violent fugitive, wanted for homicide in Guatemala, who thought a U.S. visa offered sanctuary.\n\nThrough swift and seamless international collaboration with the Government of Guatemala, this individual was arrested upon arrival in Guatemala from Los Angeles.\n\nNo matter the status, no matter the distance, those wanted for serious crimes will be held accountable.\n\n#USBP #DHS #CBP #Guatemala #Fugitive",
